    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Is used as</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">X &lt;isUsedAs&gt; Y. {Taxon} X &lt;isUsedAs&gt; {use} Y. Use this in a plant domain. - {chemical substance} X &lt;isUsedAs&gt; {use} Y. Use this for chemical substance. E.g.: apple &lt;isUsedAs&gt; fruit; alcohol &lt;isUsedAs&gt; cleaner; ddt &lt;isUsedAs&gt; pesticide;</rdfs:comment>
